e needs of dietitians and nutritionists.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"read_more\">\n         <a>\n          <img alt=\"read more\" height=\"16\" src=\"rick.jpg\" width=\"90\">\n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"blurb_row\">\n       <div class=\"blurb-left\">\n        <p>\n         <strong>\n          RemedyPractice\n         </strong>\n         <br>\n         RemedyPractice integrates with our EHRs to provide a solution for your entire office.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"read_more\">\n         <a>\n          <img alt=\"read more\" height=\"16\" src=\"rick.jpg\" width=\"90\">\n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"blurb-right\">\n        <p>\n         <strong>\n          myHealthManager\n         </strong>\n         <br>\n         myHealthManager empowers patients to take an active part in managing their health.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"read_more\">\n         <a>\n          <img alt=\"read more\" height=\"16\" src=\"rick.jpg\" width=\"90\">\n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"blurb-left\">\n        <p>\n         <strong>\n          RemedyApps\n         </strong>\n         <br>\n         RemedyApps help connect patients with their providers by creating mobile apps for your practice.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"read_more\">\n         <a>\n          <img alt=\"read more\" height=\"16\" src=\"rick.jpg\" width=\"90\">\n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <!--blurb block - close -->\n     </div>\n     <!--right column - close -->\n    </div>\n    <!--container-content - close -->\n    <!--footer - open -->\n    <div id=\"footer\">\n     <div id=\"footer-text\">\n      <p>\n       <a>\n        Home\n       </a>\n       |\n       <a>\n        Solutions\n       </a>\n       |\n       <a>\n        About Us\n       </a>\n       |\n       <a>\n        Support\n       </a>\n       |\n       <a>\n        Contact Us\